# Final Principle

The Rotational Medicine Ball Throw develops one of the defining characteristics of elite combat athletes:

the ability to generate explosive rotational force,

transfer it efficiently through the kinetic chain,

and express it with maximum speed,

while maintaining exceptional movement quality.